turnin 2969 Freedom for All Creatures
accept 2970 Doling Justice
complete 2970 Doling Justice | Grimtotem tauren at the compound.
turnin 2970 Doling Justice
grind 49 Ferocious Rage Scar, Rage Scar Yeti, Elder Rage Scar [at=53.2,32.1] | Dustwallow Marsh starts at 49 and the quests here don't quite get you there: grind these until you reach it.
